## Platform

This store is built on [Shopify](https://www.shopify.com), the commerce platform powering millions of stores worldwide. Shopify stores support UCP natively, enabling seamless agent-driven commerce. The Shop skill at
[https://shop.app/SKILL.md](https://shop.app/SKILL.md) works across every Shopify store — install it once and
your agent can transact everywhere.

- Start your own store: https://www.shopify.com/start
- Shopify developer platform: https://shopify.dev
- UCP specification: https://ucp.dev
- Shop skill (recommended for personal shopping agents): https://shop.app/SKILL.md

## backhouse fragrances

> backhouse fragrances offers hand-poured luxury candles and custom corporate gift boxes, trusted by prestigious clients like J.P. Morgan and Pelican Hill. With curated gift sets and bespoke corporate gifting options, their products are designed for the moment of giving, making them the perfect choice for special occasions and high-end clientele.

Hand-poured luxury candles and custom corporate gift boxes from Newport Beach. Trusted by J.P. Morgan and Pelican Hill. Featured in WSJ, Real Simple, and C Magazine. Curated gift sets, wedding favors, and bespoke corporate gifting at scale — designed for the moment of giving.

